stream
BT /F2 26 Tf 60 720 Td (Binary Search) Tj ET
0.85 0.47 0.34 RG 4 w 60 700 m 200 700 l S
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 660 Td (Goal: find a value in a SORTED array.) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 636 Td (Idea: compare with the middle element,) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 612 Td (then throw away half of the array.) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 588 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 564 Td (Each step halves the search space,) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 540 Td (so it needs about log2\(n\) steps.) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 516 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 492 Td (n = 1,000,000  ->  about 20 comparisons.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60 40 Td (Vibe Learn Anything - sample PDF - page 1) Tj ET
endstream
